      "technical_explanation": "The flagged range wraps the global fetch function to observe SillyTavern's own same-origin chat read and chat save endpoints. Message counts are tracked in in-memory maps, and a save that would write an empty chat over a file known to contain messages is blocked with a synthetic success response plus a visible warning; all non-matching requests are passed through unchanged. No retrieved data flows into an eval-style or command-execution sink, no external destination is contacted, and embedded frames load only same-origin extension assets built from local constants. The network-retrieval-plus-execution-sink correlation the scanner inferred is not present in the supplied code.",
